OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Incredibly special' - William reveals
OL,4,Ahis favourite view from first home with
OL,5,ACatherine
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prince reminisced about the view of
OL,8,FNewborough Forest, the beach and
OL,9,FLlanddwyn Island from the farmhouse -
OL,10,Fthe first home of their elder son,
OL,11,FPrince George - describing running
OL,12,Falong the beach and the "magical"
OL,13,Flandscape.
OL,15,FAs guest editor, he also took the
OL,16,Fopportunity to talk about the
OL,17,Fimportance of protecting women in the
OL,18,Farmed forces and shared his "fanatical"
OL,19,Fsupport for Aston Villa.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
